{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":73,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":["Book III "]},{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Psalm of Asaph. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 73:1"},"Truly God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," good to Israel, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," to such as are of a clean heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 73:2"},"But as for me, my feet were almost gone; my steps had well nigh slipped. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 73:3"},"For I was envious at the foolish, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," I saw the prosperity of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 73:4"},"For ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there are"]}," no bands in their death: but their strength ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," firm. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 73:5"},"They ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," not in trouble ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as other"]}," men; neither are they plagued like ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["other"]}," men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 73:6"},"Therefore pride compasseth them about as a chain; violence covereth them ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a garment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 73:7"},"Their eyes stand out with fatness: they have more than heart could wish. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 73:8"},"They are corrupt, and speak wickedly ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["concerning"]}," oppression: they speak loftily. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 73:9"},"They set their mouth against the heavens, and their tongue walketh through the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 73:10"},"Therefore his people return hither: and waters of a full ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["cup "]},"are wrung out to them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 73:11"},"And they say, How doth God know? and is there knowledge in the most High? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 73:12"},"Behold, these ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the ungodly, who prosper in the world; they increase ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in"]}," riches. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 73:13"},"Verily I have cleansed my heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in"]}," vain, and washed my hands in innocency. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 73:14"},"For all the day long have I been plagued, and chastened every morning. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 73:15"},"If I say, I will speak thus; behold, I should offend ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["against "]},"the generation of thy children. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 73:16"},"When I thought to know this, it ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," too painful for me; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 73:17"},"Until I went into the sanctuary of God; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["then"]}," understood I their end. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 73:18"},"Surely thou didst set them in slippery places: thou castedst them down into destruction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 73:19"},"How are they ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["brought"]}," into desolation, as in a moment! they are utterly consumed with terrors. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 73:20"},"As a dream when ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["one"]}," awaketh; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so,"]}," O Lord, when thou awakest, thou shalt despise their image. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 73:21"},"Thus my heart was grieved, and I was pricked in my reins. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 73:22"},"So foolish ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," I, and ignorant: I was ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a beast before thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 73:23"},"Nevertheless I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," continually with thee: thou hast holden ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me"]}," by my right hand. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 73:24"},"Thou shalt guide me with thy counsel, and afterward receive me ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to"]}," glory. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:24"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PSA 73:25"},"Whom have I in heaven ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but thee?"]}," and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," none upon earth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," I desire beside thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:25"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PSA 73:26"},"My flesh and my heart faileth: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the strength of my heart, and my portion for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:26"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PSA 73:27"},"For, lo, they that are far from thee shall perish: thou hast destroyed all them that go a whoring from thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:27"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PSA 73:28"},"But ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," good for me to draw near to God: I have put my trust in the Lord GOD, that I may declare all thy works. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 73:28"}]}]}
